BCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Merge! Fashion! Drama! \\u003cbr\\u003eFrom girl next door to Hollywood sensation, experience the celebrity life now!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLife in LA is tough and running back and forth from your part-time job to acting auditions to be an extra isn\\u0026#39;t all that glamorous either. However, by some miracle, you find out you\\u0026#39;re actually the long-lost daughter of Hollywood actor Peter Dake.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhen you learn about your family history, your whole world is turned upside down. Well, what you thought would be a life of ease, turns out to be anything but. It turns out your half-sister Rose detests you, your caring boyfriend is hiding something from you, and the media is relentless.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe challenges just keep coming. It\\u0026#39;s time to use your unique style and charisma to show the world what you\\u0026#39;re made of!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e - Easy merge gameplay. Merge simple clothes to create elegant fashion items! Unlock rare designs and create one-of-a-kind outfits.\\u003cbr\\u003e - Over 1,000 style options to dress for the red carpet, parties, auditions, and other events.\\u003cbr\\u003e - A plot full of twists and turns. How will your story end?\\u003cbr\\u003e - Develop friendships and romantic relationships with different characters in the storyline!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to start your journey from unnamed extra to Hollywood icon?\"],\"VoyagerOne IE\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nXa_U1uG1moEFWRt-YeQC0VBShF_731o2jWYQV3jNKiLJcXAF6gQ-NWcHyPg-P709yETfUU9xPFrQpJqU4AIGQ\"],null,[240,235,230,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random I