ge together and become top-class hotel managers!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRenovate Theme Hotels \\u003cbr\\u003eBuy new land, renovate old buildings, and turn them into wonderful hotels. Experience a totally different hotel style all over the world and throughout the ages!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild Relationships\\u003cbr\\u003eMeet guests from around the world. Listen to their stories and exchange fun life experiences. Guess who might find their true love during the journey?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThere are hidden surprises waiting for you to discover! Join us on the journey of expanding Hotel Empires!\"],\"Century Games Innovation Pte. Ltd.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KDL2eRDsgjpaZP8B0DfHudGf6zWE_4rz8jMk924St4qSZHhULB-RIGixLGGmtc-t_pcgHMSRtetE1VEESDrs\"],null,[163,38,35,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fatr.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fatr.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM