1aYEsQFNYviQ\"]],[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sxsWv4uUEGtp1xONkN7dZ4s78czrxvNzVNj_pk9vHuYYJVKCnDdMrVujApk93WChmfaWaLmSpbIW-lXuPe4BjQ\"]],[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dygVkyu8Oy5wiXAiWdl6R-zekyUsuNpa5IDJrvtgH1UHMP0NmOEcu8-aCYmspewBVKgoG0fYRHRJBfGCiAGq\"]]],\"Pirate Kings™️\",[\"4.3\",4.2617064],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.jellybtn.cashkingmobile\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.jellybtn.cashkingmobile\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.jellybtn.cashkingmobile\"]],[\"qgJrGmkIGkoTCKLtirHHkJcDFf2nrAIdCDQci/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPQohChtjb20uamVsbHlidG4uY2FzaGtpbmdtb2JpbGUQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"paDGCKHF89s\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:paDGCKHF89s?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:paDGCKHF89s\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkbUswaBNljdi8rQwg8e6PKN-CXtHrxLM1D3eyPFb3ZNCJgTM9i1HeZtEp9Da-CrZLH8xmBUVEWsez22WNcDCCoAXJJzOewcj3bWg_xAPYCj_gbrkVMEFBQYwcx828hRx1M80kLNqxzzr0xI4jzCEd0azb2Q1PWNSB4jD55ZXcpOP6xeUwYoU6-HEeEP7jIcnWgMC-1Y69gQuTlWlfUOw2mXJS9EJLVUuCMgDw-xUlLdsZLEBgZ-WiS4dXued_8Wr4dtQS4RxqrpbMMHx-RFPtjS6v8oaKrzBjM58ICvB0odg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/paDGCKHF89s/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Sound the Alarm! It’s time to attack, revenge and steal your friends’ pirate treasure in this epic online pirate game experience! Shall you live the pirates’ life? \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAhoy there, matey - it\\u0026#39;s time to tell friend from foe! \\u003cbr\\u003e- Invite your friends...and then attack their lands, steal their stuff, raid their loot...and watch your friends’ islands go Boom!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Build your pirate kingdom, and defend it from your pirates friends’ revenge!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Stash coins, prizes and all the pirate treasure you can carry to build your islands! \\u003cbr\\u003e- Be the master of your own pirate kingdom - avast, ye who draw near!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Master the slot of good fortune for loot and other goodies!!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWill you be the richest Pirate King of all? Or will you lose it all in a friend’s raid on your loot? \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAll’s fair in love and pirate games. So be the Pirate King. Enjoy brand new swashbuckling adventures, live the pirate-y life all wrapped up in the thrill of an online multiplayer game. Master and build your own pirate lands in this social pirate adventure game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBooms, Bonuses and Loot Ahoy: Epic Island Adventures Await!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIt‘s a whole new adventure, matey! \\u003cbr\\u003e- Spin, win coins, and use them to upgrade your pirate island for brand new goodies.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Check out the all-new Pirate Missions! Follow the map and search for legendary treasures...who knows which coins and goodies ye shall find? \\u003cbr\\u003e- Collect new pirate cards, and complete the Pirate album for even more epic loot and pirate game goodies!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLove pirate games? Play Pirate Kings with friends and win coins (and other pirate treasure)! Play Pirate Kings and win coins!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBecome the greatest pirate captain of all your friends: pirate adventures are even more fun with your friends, so invite them all! For the best multiplayer game experience, invite fellow pirates and your Facebook friends for even more coins, and to join in the fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is Pirate Kings – the multiplayer pirate game where you choose to be a friend, dozer or a foe. Will you take revenge or will you show no mercy? ‘Tis the pirate game life, arrrr!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLet’s sail away to new horizons. Lower your sails, load your cannons and conquer the 7 seas, pirate-style! Get in the adventure game spirit and become the richest Pirate King of all (loot those coins)!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGift coins and treasures to your friends - who said all pirates were bad?\\u003cbr\\u003eAnything goes in the most pirate-tastic multiplayer game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Pirate Kings on Facebook and Instagram for exclusive bonuses and prizes!\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: facebook.com/CashKingPirates/\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: instagram.com/thepiratekings/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBrought to you by Jelly Button, a Playtika studio.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePirate Kings is intended for those 18 and older. Pirate Kings does not require payment to download and play, but it also allows you to purchase virtual items with real money inside the game, including random items. You can disable in-app purchases in your device’s settings. Pirate Kings may also contain advertising. You may require an internet connection to play Pirate Kings and access its social features. You can also find more information about the functionality, compatibility and interoperability of Pirate Kings in the above description and additional app store information. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading this game, you agree to future game updates as released on your app store or social network. You may choose to update this game, but if you do not update, your game experience and functionalities may be reduced.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://www.playtika.com/terms-service/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Notice: https://www.playtika.com/privacy-notice/\"],\"Playtika\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qH5vDKp5xpY8zsvk_WovZJ2lLekGa4d7VYNgupy1LamCBQo_GWTht2RbRCY-fjgg7gDzqY1UZGmRbHicrfodew\"],null,[222,249,206,255]],null,