sercontent.com/blfeqdTG6LIrnTtNwhP-_FT_va9IHdpcRDCebi-8WdMNlbBLtfbCLLc60na1U2-QZEHEaiXt07TCVY66eR-7gQ\"]]],\"Plato: Fun Multiplayer Games\",[\"4.7\",4.6585245],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plato.android\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.plato.android\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plato.android\"]],[\"qgJhGl8IIEoTCKLtirHHkJcDFf2nrAIdCDQci/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMwoXChFjb20ucGxhdG8uYW5kcm9pZBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"aEOekbS-pYU\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:aEOekbS-pYU?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:aEOekbS-pYU\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezl8td4_G3JJyaMjEWfK3jFu4DPE4AckhUX9tf0AhHSoAP-Ly4CZ3T7NZ-24wA9ln1dqUT8M8eM04f9lSig8hAIl5CNhf_sjuwZrsgZa9EbyH4nwB_4SEjlU9jRc_Mg3F-QjW8-svfnoVLR-YuAUrKAevjovz0-Tue0viLYugCA_QTBZz3NeO3DHgx87SYjfAIGFF_pFaBg6WfRgUEc_50VsIi6PkyMSLtiIe3del8SfWzeazhTmfXG5USgosKgw3JvXXkroOQ7OZ_b6uKrjtSBfNA9POXEx2xEyRHa9LNSf-Q\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aEOekbS-pYU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Plato, where gaming meets chatting in the most epic way possible. Play online with over 50 amazing multiplayer team games. Social fun awaits - play with friends or match up with someone new. Play and challenge your friends directly in our chat games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You\\u0026#39;ll Love Plato’s Online Chat and Team Games:\\u003cbr\\u003e● Multiplayer Games Galore: Challenge your friends with 50 top-tier online mini games like Ocho (Crazy Eights) 8️⃣, Pool 🎱, and Carrom 🥏 there\\u0026#39;s always something fun to play. Whether you\\u0026#39;re into sports, classic board games, or strategy games - we\\u0026#39;ve got you covered.\\u003cbr\\u003e● Ad-Free Fun: Say goodbye to annoying ads and pay-to-win schemes with free games. Plato is all about pure, uninterrupted fun while gaming and chatting with friends - making it the ultimate place to be social.\\u003cbr\\u003e● Personalization Paradise: Personalize your profile, group chat themes, and game experiences.  Make Plato truly yours while you play online team games.\\u003cbr\\u003e● Team games with Friends: Play chat games with Plato—it\\u0026#39;s a fully fledged messenger. Engage in group chats, chat rooms, and even voice chat for the ultimate social experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e● Social fun awaits with Team Games: There\\u0026#39;s always a chance to prove you\\u0026#39;re the best. Climb the leaderboards and earn bragging rights among your gaming friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e● Privacy First: Play multiplayer games without having to worry about unnecessary data being collected.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCheck out all the multiplayer games!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBoard Games:\\u003cbr\\u003e● Carrom 🥏\\u003cbr\\u003e● Checkers 🏁\\u003cbr\\u003e● Chess ♟️\\u003cbr\\u003e● Cribbage\\u003cbr\\u003e● Backgammon ⚪\\u003cbr\\u003e● Dice Party 🎲\\u003cbr\\u003e● Dominoes ◻️\\u003cbr\\u003e●Four in a Row ⭕\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStrategy Games \\u0026amp; Puzzles:\\u003cbr\\u003e● Minesweepers 💣\\u003cbr\\u003e● Wordbox\\u003cbr\\u003e● Go ☯️\\u003cbr\\u003e● Literati\\u003cbr\\u003e● Mancala\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCard Games:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Poker ♣️\\u003cbr\\u003e● Spades\\u003cbr\\u003e● Gin Rummy♦️\\u003cbr\\u003e● Hearts ♥️\\u003cbr\\u003e● Go Fish 🎣\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBoard \\u0026amp; Party Games:\\u003cbr\\u003e● Ludo 🟠\\u003cbr\\u003e● Bingo 🅱️\\u003cbr\\u003e● Dots \\u0026amp; Boxes ☑️\\u003cbr\\u003e● Bankroll\\u003cbr\\u003e● Werewolf (Mafia)🐺\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSports \\u0026amp; Action Games\\u003cbr\\u003e● Archery 🏹\\u003cbr\\u003e● Bounce\\u003cbr\\u003e● Basketball 🏀\\u003cbr\\u003e● Bowling 🎳\\u003cbr\\u003e● Carrom 🔴\\u003cbr\\u003e● Cup Pong\\u003cbr\\u003e● Darts 🎯\\u003cbr\\u003e● Mini Golf ⛳️\\u003cbr\\u003e● Table Soccer ⚽\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlato Originals:\\u003cbr\\u003e● Match Monsters 💎\\u003cbr\\u003e● Brawlbots\\u003cbr\\u003e● Plox 👾\\u003cbr\\u003e● Blitz League\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin millions of players around the world who made Plato their go-to app for multiplayer and chat games with friends. Download Plato today and experience the ultimate fusion of fun and friendship in online games!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHave a question? E-mail us at hello@platoapp.com, we’d love to hear from you.\"],\"Plato Team Inc.\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FdjCEMYNwyY1BFfgSronuhGTmXdrXBIzW0RrzUok0boQvimoVeWnSK-CwMrB7XlFrKlU4RLvK3RqrmlVWaM7Gw\"],null,[37,36,98,255]],null,[\"Rated for 18+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QNpsl4k43vdbfwUAlVLZul2W5O5MUGOToystzghc97mljVHbUwtc639tahcuDsAVHdaGMyZA40AmMVcB_ws\"]],[null,\"Simulated Gambling\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-App Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/stIOCymv1bYIi3UU_owFeyNt30CkUXbNlDj81ZWtjW9NBIMJxI47i_psYIr0Ho430Rm6mByCGNLORloB\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plato.android\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.plato.android\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 4.49 - RM 919.99 p