ps://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ucKWnkLB7o8EW8JrOaBhoRrzslAJpH0EYUIBS5C_zB1m5OvyhWAKFevtO27tbRf0e6eSTqd18z9vTqqv-MozKCM\"]]],\"Dreamscape Island: Farm \\u0026 Cook\",[\"4.9\",4.880734],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.aidiangames.garden.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.aidiangames.garden.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.aidiangames.garden.gp\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIIkoTCKLtirHHkJcDFf2nrAIdCDQci/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOwofChljb20uYWlkaWFuZ2FtZXMuZ2FyZGVuLmdwEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"km8cZc6Y7Mc\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:km8cZc6Y7Mc?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:km8cZc6Y7Mc\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmG4AEJKqctwZwsBYik11jPSD8ipEXPlDbGUhlldcrfJau4hqkirXAznT5t2bkkMc6dCXI2JNX68mL_uoLJLdSIg4SntjWmuEmI7b2n9m1DXEMaCnbtu8Rc2b9yhBr4QEHxOghkDjT9vyjeRsvmjohzmFT9NnguA3U4Bx7lkECGzkbJIrs0CA0R7IndmCe4qJ6d2jKrAGlZTyCD6BDFzjdpslAJw828LjoUBWr-TzyuLzVgIU9wcQITe3MfqqlN8bpk9PdX6JLhRLphmHrfTPmlm1tkS-uwVcNDoMF65SXEjQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/km8cZc6Y7Mc/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Dreamscape Island, a cozy farming and life simulation game where good food and simple pleasures bring each day to life. Grow crops, make friends and shape your own island retreat at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom planting your first seed to serving a delicious feast, enjoy the quiet satisfaction of watching your garden grow and sharing the warmth of a home-cooked meal.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFROM YOUR GARDEN TO YOUR TABLE\\u003cbr\\u003eGrow crops, raise chickens and other farm animals, and catch fresh seafood. Turn your harvest into delicious dishes, then choose how to plate and present them. With a little care, even a simple meal can become a feast.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYOUR ISLAND RESTAURANT\\u003cbr\\u003eFill customer orders, expand your island and unlock new ingredients and recipes. Build your humble food stall into a restaurant known far and wide, one satisfying meal at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAME FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Settle into Island Life\\u003cbr\\u003eFarm, care for animals, go fishing and gather seafood along the shore. Slow down and enjoy the little things on your own peaceful island.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Bring Delicious Recipes to Life\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock recipes and explore different ingredients, proportions, serving dishes and plating styles. Enjoy every step of creating a meal, from choosing what goes in to adding the finishing touches.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Visit Friends and Borrow Ingredients\\u003cbr\\u003eStop by your friends\\u0026#39; islands and borrow the ingredients you need without reducing their supplies. Help each other gather what you need and keep your kitchens cooking.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e4. Design an Island That Feels Like Home\\u003cbr\\u003ePlan your island\\u0026#39;s layout and decorate your farm, restaurant and more. Mix, match and arrange each space to create a style that\\u0026#39;s all your own.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e5. Follow Her Fresh Start\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow the heroine\\u0026#39;s journey from an office worker unsure of her path to a confident restaurant owner. Watch her find her feet as she builds a new life on the island.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlant a little, cook a little and make yourself at home on Dreamscape Island.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://sites.google.com/view/dreamscapeisland-service\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://sites.google.com/view/dreamscapeisland-privacy\"],\"Aidian Network\",\"50,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZoJrApyBIOWe9I42oXFehlpj37iiIqz2Jy0_U_Vw1ZiF86HKYe2sC900IgKUbY9I2i29aZCXuyEPgr3cTYENNqM\"],null,[186,145,120,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.aidiangames.garden.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.aidiangames.garden.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 1.49 - RM 3,099.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.pixeland.talkingbuddy\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aCFKvuVLGck9GVBdG_sh_ChQaAH00ilLrXWxizZ3ArxfElbtlC4ZpBsNZec-7Ii1JJbuQU6T9JAYhOhomAcn\"],null,[251,94,183,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9v8cx3Of5sbckarhKE1s64uOSxIai8-HwnhD9PZ-OyLZe6Duj9XNUC-H0Iugg8zpRlRkvk4-Ut4fYfRYrUacuw\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https