to the thrilling universe of trucks with an addictive Match-3 puzzle game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEmbark on a journey of unmatched realism and experience the exhilaration of Truck Simulator, all within a single game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience a unique blend of simulation and tycoon gameplay for an unparalleled gaming experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePersonalize your trucks with customizable lights, bumpers, horns, and more!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAssemble the ultimate fleet of trucks you\\u0026#39;ve always dreamed of.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStay tuned for frequent updates and more exciting features!\"],\"Century Games PTE. LTD.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/w6WBCpODsoe7CsLdORRb6tW0VAQ2PwFbh58iZ9PfazCPT-o6f_wujI7S_Id7ferjzTMjfDtkYUFKfaIxW0CuYQ\"],null,[95,157,220,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.vm3.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.vm3.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 4.90 - RM 539.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]