003eNo more lonely late-night fishing - unlock intimate interactions, exclusive scenes, and all kinds of irresistible charm waiting for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e[Unprecedented Deals, Biggest Discounts Ever]\\u003cbr\\u003eA festival of madness - up to 60% off across the board!\\u003cbr\\u003eGet a 1+1 Hero bonus, and earn up to 160,000,000,000,000 Coins back!\\u003cbr\\u003eDouble draws in gacha and wheel, blast your way to ultra-value fortune bags - dive into mountains of coins till your fingers go numb!\\u003cbr\\u003e[Instant VIP, Become a Big Boss Effortlessly]\\u003cbr\\u003eNew players grow fast with ease - unlock the Supreme VIP experience in one tap!\\u003cbr\\u003eComplete missions to earn rare treasures. Upgrade cannons for instant HP regen and massive coin refunds!\\u003cbr\\u003ePlus a 24/7 private butler at your service - zero stress, maximum fun. This is how true kings play!\\u003cbr\\u003e[Endless Fire, Quick Screen Wipe]\\u003cbr\\u003eOver 100 unique BOSS fish rotate onto the battlefield, showering your screen with golden rain!\\u003cbr\\u003eChain combos for instant clears. Legendary mega-fish drop insane loot - watch your wealth skyrocket beyond control!\\u003cbr\\u003e[Lucky Egg Smash, Multiplier Frenzy]\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect relief funds with ease! Choose between Lucky Eggs or Diamond Eggs - smash golden eggs for outrageous fortune, with rewards soaring up to 100x!\\u003cbr\\u003e[King\\u0026#39;s Hegemony, Peak PvP Showdown]\\u003cbr\\u003eWho will rule the entire server? Hunt down bosses, earn points, climb rankings, and seize the throne of the Supreme Rank!\\u003cbr\\u003eTrack your hunting stats anytime - prove your worth and earn your Fish King medals!\\u003cbr\\u003ePlayful emotes, real-time social rooms, catch big fish and make new friends all at once!\"],\"HOMELAND INTERACTIVE T\\u0026E PTE. LTD.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/m6FDK2I8Dv6aLXZeLVNnQcgc1DKztX