ll,null,null,\"AXH1ezlLbT9EmoDWlT621DARtUwgwSwK3B93WE-gcZ1qnqkoegmJpeBa80Lnl6szZcriQI1-x2Tl25Tm048juX8VnHamyzO974ULQ-cN9TeiwwWmhdNy4iwpUOf5xT95UbK2BjsMuorXeHw6wYI0o_3K3xovML6W76aKJWvt13MzVVGjqxOMbKbecp6vbKBkk3noaBv2sNh0d-0jqZVPv2xhh8fmyPXBMX_-Vb-gpuiW5QdU6_jfYZ1dWjBXndRIpLDU1r8LOx6oqO5BH8dZwsduQUMqArUkOPNQdGlmC67-wSrNCA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rcRYTduJgsM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Play this friendly game with your family, Facebook friends and millions of other players around the world. Attack, spin, and steal your way from island to island, to travel through tons of unique villages to earn coin and help Luna and her friend find her missing father. \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eDo you have the courage to defeat pirate attacks, to master island challenges, or to steal coins from the greatest cash kings? Play any role you like as Island King. Become a master of coin who holds trillions of coins and rule the realm! Or become a fierce pirate king to smash and raid neighboring islands! Devise your own master plan to get bonus spins and steal other player Jackpots.   \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your Island villages into Viking Settlements, Indian Palaces, Mystic Temples and many more unique world-inspired destinations with your closest family and friends. Raid coins from anyone and everyone, even friends! Love board games like monopoly, bingo or solitaire but want to play online with family and friends, try Island King today!  \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e【Spin the wheel to earn coins and free Spins】 \\u003cbr\\u003eSpin the magical wheel to earn your fortune, attack, raid, or steal coins. Shield your islands and coins from other player raids. Build your island with coins and move up to unlock new destination islands. Become the Island King with the best island and the master of collecting coins! \\u003cbr\\u003eSpin the wheel can also gain free Spins by finishing interesting puzzles and challenges! \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e【Collect all valuable cards】 \\u003cbr\\u003eCollect cards and exchange with your family and Facebook friends to complete the puzzle sets, you can win tons of coins for free! Finish building your islands and unlock the next set of cards. \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e【Play with your friends】 \\u003cbr\\u003eJoin our Facebook Community to meet new friends, join a tribe, learn new game trivia, and earn millions of coins by the slot machines and scratch card mini games. Trade your cards in the community and play together to boost your progress!   \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us: https://www.facebook.com/IslandKingApp/ \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eAny problems or feedback, please contact IslandKing@forevernine.com. Good Luck!\"],\"HK DENGSHEN TECHNOLOGY CO., LIMITED\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9YWg6vavwWGAwex37yHEEkpmrjXlRtr8ZxmRB4Lvqvyw6zFfBoNHpSbCIqoEmXZ26D4DokGbIpyHIgULMd6N_Q\"],null,[42,47,24,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.aladinfun.islandking.android\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.aladinfun.islandking.android\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003