dary journey!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【Limited-Time Mythic Hero Skin】\\u003cbr\\u003eA brand-new limited Mythic Hero Skin is here! Unlock the exclusive look and unleash even greater power!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【Addictive Roguelike Idle Gameplay】\\u003cbr\\u003eSingle mode with infinite roguelike stages! Using strategy to pass the stages, reasonable collocation position and easy to win!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【Merge and Ascend】\\u003cbr\\u003eSummon, merge, and power up your heroes! Every run brings new combinations, surprises, and possibilities.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【New Lord Skin】\\u003cbr\\u003eThe brand-new Lord Skin has arrived! Transform into the legendary Journey to the West hero, unlock exclusive look, and set out on a whole new adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【Multiple Upgrade Paths】\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore a wide variety of merge and upgrade paths. Choose your own progression route and build your ultimate team!\\u0026quot;\"],\"MOREFUN（H.K.) LIMITED\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/759dop4hgd5rwU0WZWb3H4BiCpMJm4PBiXUUL0q-Cb7HuOLPvvE_e_jVyWBLB4DvegfFmQ90-YvszDzdvTerOg\"],null,[247,229,162,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Moderate Violence\"],[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.googl