lay-lh.googleusercontent.com/Y_PYZJX6OsRYgrHn-itPUrO6jXxTKuZRVhbtNBurr1gs1Ua2eHqjo8yObpJlKRjLQxx1xpeaxTV1hEDu096W6w\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pPxuWTfQqN4ZZ4KtPAOZk94_-DeL8u1sDYDtSBH2nX4utdjHU5VyNByVvZ8lk1SDgDuhRARGKM3FMkJTuXbX\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O14vI2bNX-cVychy4NpbUV-YjfpCCxkAfs5bHaMJ00hodRcViz5iLiRlzpGQfW-e2mq7vS9u-WU4_DbsG6qeig\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gXgTbJjiv-h36VuHsPtY3C3jaM8h8_LoAiHs68FW4wmJdDONKXKOBLANa0FVVKM2RPOT9yA6vMHLQZAXujyH\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9pva54mHf6Qg0Th7OTW7rKSY8nEp_SxNZYJasThNRUTxAoUhP4F1YTuP0iMIFiCOwLBes41TNuFNyZKr3HDtTg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8s7gmPMZvchwdYtCtiXYrnJ6u8tSjXyIzflLoiwTBXlrxfBIQZ3zhvpWIYe35aLkvLaAql2RE7lBfJ48lGCR\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Y_PYZJX6OsRYgrHn-itPUrO6jXxTKuZRVhbtNBurr1gs1Ua2eHqjo8yObpJlKRjLQxx1xpeaxTV1hEDu096W6w\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O14vI2bNX-cVychy4NpbUV-YjfpCCxkAfs5bHaMJ00hodRcViz5iLiRlzpGQfW-e2mq7vS9u-WU4_DbsG6qeig\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pPxuWTfQqN4ZZ4KtPAOZk94_-DeL8u1sDYDtSBH2nX4utdjHU5VyNByVvZ8lk1SDgDuhRARGKM3FMkJTuXbX\"]]],\"Drop the Cat!\",[\"4.5\",4.5436893],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cat.hole.puzzle.aos\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.cat.hole.puzzle.aos\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cat.hole.puzzle.aos\"]],[\"qgJnGmUIQkoTCKLtirHHkJcDFf2nrAIdCDQci/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOQodChdjb20uY2F0LmhvbGUucHV6emxlLmFvcxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Drop the Cat: A Fun Casual Puzzle Game Adventure 🐱🧩✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Drop the Cat!\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is the ultimate casual puzzle game that perfectly blends bright and colorful cat visuals 🌈, addictive block puzzle mechanics 🧱, and smart logic puzzle challenges 🧠. This easy puzzle game is designed to be both a relaxing, healing game 🍵 and a stimulating brain game ⚡️. If you love match puzzles or want a great puzzle you can enjoy anytime, this is the perfect choice.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Overview 🔍\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this fun and colorful puzzle, slide the holes and drop the cats into the matching colors.\\u003cbr\\u003eSounds simple? Think again! 🤔 As you progress, creative obstacles and tricky paths appear, and solving them requires clever logic and strategy 🧭.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features ⭐️\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy-to-learn but deep puzzle mechanics 🎯\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCute cat visuals for a delightful casual game experience 🐾\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThrilling time limits for a true brain challenge ⏱️\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFun match mechanics that grow harder over time 📈\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGreat for fans of both easy puzzles and logic puzzles 🧩🧠\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play 🎮\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery stage offers a new puzzle challenge 🌟\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSlide the blocks and match the cats with their correct colors 🎨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUse logic to figure out the best path 🧠➡️\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeels like a mini brain game you can enjoy anytime, anywhere 🕒\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Objectives 🎯\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFreely slide blocks 🧱\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch colors correctly 🎨✅\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAvoid traps and blockers 🚧\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve each logic puzzle strategically ♟️\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay at your own pace – it’s meant to be relaxing 🧘\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Drop the Cat Stands Out 🏆\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis isn’t just another casual puzzle game—it’s a complete brain game experience 💡.\\u003cbr\\u003eWith each level, your thinking becomes sharper while the fun increases 📚➡️🎉.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe combination of match × logic puzzle × block puzzle makes it uniquely addictive 🔗.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re a beginner or a seasoned puzzle player, you’ll find both fun and challenge here.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA Puzzle for Everyone 👨\\u200d👩\\u200d👧\\u200d👦\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAn ideal easy puzzle for all ages 🌱\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDesigned for both casual and strategic players 🎯\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for fans of block puzzles and relaxing mechanics 🧩🍃\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGreat for breaks, commutes, or relaxing at home ☕️🛋️\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Now ⤵️\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThousands of players are already enjoying Drop the Cat 🎉.\\u003cbr\\u003eA light and fun match game, a thoughtful logic puzzle, and a beautiful relaxing game—\\u003cbr\\u003eall rolled into one easy puzzle 🐱💖.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and start your colorful, clever, and endlessly fun brain game journey today! 🚀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMore Reasons to Love Drop the Cat 💬\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTired of noisy, pay-to-win games? 🙉💸\\u003cbr\\u003eDrop the Cat focuses on pure fun, logic, and satisfaction ✅.\\u003cbr\\u003eWith intuitive controls, colorful design, and rewarding level progression, it’s the perfect relaxing puzzle to spend time with ⏳🌈.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMany players say each stage feels like a mini brain game 🧠.\\u003cbr\\u003eAs puzzles grow more complex, the satisfying loop of think → plan → slide → clear keeps you hooked 🔄.\\u003cbr\\u003eTake the adventure anywhere—quick sessions fit perfectly into commutes, lines, and short breaks 🚇🧳🕒!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvolving Difficulty, Never Boring 🔄\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game starts with simple, easy puzzle stages that teach the basic rules 📘.\\u003cbr\\u003eBut as you continue, new elements like blockers, portals, and multiple exits appear 🚪🌀,\\u003cbr\\u003etransforming each stage into a true logic puzzle that makes you stop and think ahead 🧭🧠.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you play for 5 minutes or 50, every session is rich and engaging ⏱️✨.\\u003cbr\\u003eAnd because it’s a casual game, there’s no rush.\\u003cbr\\u003eTake your time, relax, and solve each block puzzle at your own pace—no stress, no pressure 🍀😌.\"],\"ACTIONFIT Inc.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kxywqjeZ4caTCwm-lYk8dS2VZ7iW4pxGbH2YVQ-MZm1zpAl3-mRUFr71z-aMlUPjWm9uVZhtIUHsQSUgS5NFtQ\"],null,[192,201,231,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cat.hole.puzzle.aos\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.cat.hole.puzzle.aos\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,f