L0RMxlaWV5_i3DCqtO77dTBIrLGKegO4\"]]],\"Wool Escape 3D: ASMR Game\",[\"4.5\",4.53],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.drg.woolpuzzle3d\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.drg.woolpuzzle3d\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.drg.woolpuzzle3d\"]],[\"qgJkGmIISkoTCKLtirHHkJcDFf2nrAIdCDQci/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgoaChRjb20uZHJnLndvb2xwdXp6bGUzZBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to the cozy yarn universe of Wool Escape 3D! Rotate the 3D scene, aim accurately, and gently pull to rescue wool balls! Match colorful balls to fill the painting above and create stunning artwork!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play? Just 3 Steps!!\\u003cbr\\u003ePull Yarn:\\u003cbr\\u003eRotate the scene \\u0026amp; find loose wool balls to pull.\\u003cbr\\u003eWarning: Random pulls cause jams! Observe first!\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch Colors:\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect three same-color wool balls to auto-fill the painting.\\u003cbr\\u003eUse the Hold Spool for temporary storage—don’t fill it up!\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild Art:\\u003cbr\\u003eEach color set unlocked reveals hidden lines of a masterpiece.\\u003cbr\\u003eTons of paintings await—feel the achievement rush!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Choose Wool Escape 3D?\\u003cbr\\u003e- Super Relaxing: Fluffy visuals and soft sounds melt stress in 5 mins! No timers! Pause anytime—perfect for commutes!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Brain Boosting: Hundreds of levels from easy to mind-bending—train your 3D thinking!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Smart Tools: Out of space? Get the Expansion Box! Stuck? Magic Magnet to instantly collect wool balls! Need to reset storage? The Storage Broom clears your hold spool instantly!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect For Everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003eCasual Players: Quick 5-minute chill sessions. Ideal for breaks!\\u003cbr\\u003ePuzzle Masters: Tackle complex levels—so hard it’ll make you scratch your head!\\u003cbr\\u003eCollectors: Unlock ALL paintings for special rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Wool Escape 3D’s magical world, every pull is a victory of logic, every color sparks art. You’re not just a solver—you’re a \\u0026quot;Master Color Weaver\\u0026quot; crafting art with yarn!\"],\"DRAGON RISING PTE. LTD.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-WmCci_jYdVUzs13TeNP1FAsn4y4jm-JF1gEAlB5clKsEO2zbmdhZAd5_J8fFGd4OgjTd5suHCoTkb_lpEig\"],null,[226,226,226,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Implied Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.drg.woolpuzzle3d\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.drg.woolpuzzle3d\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 3.99 - RM 454.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,nu