ll,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nOnKHuYEKZadzUaKm458sfhud85VGWXpkNUIAknJkNH0ryKNsAB5szkRcm57dnAigbvaYZvHW2M9Uufaa2E2Sg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qekip5o-6WZozcGlxRj3etmv69XTnP7ygIf1X5pZ4Hfa_-E3cQU2hM8p7VBEmITEIycPnZJ1EJ1hOG4fajfa9A\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XtJy9HhEohEc5FPIW1gDk43cyMfG7N9QHoT_BDK76esr-wGhrEgTiNuSmym24ab5jO7RQG1UAmyMwIgQuHrdCw\"]]],\"ChoiceCraft: Interactive Novel\",[\"4.1\",4.12],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.choice.craft\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.choice.craft\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.choice.craft\"]],[\"qgJgGl4IUUoTCKLtirHHkJcDFf2nrAIdCDQci/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMgoWChBjb20uY2hvaWNlLmNyYWZ0EAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"ChoiceCraft is a playable interactive novel where YOU steer the story. Choose who to love, how to rise, and what to become. Customize your name, outfits, and storylines — one choice can change everything.\\u003cbr\\u003ePOPULAR TITLES\\u003cbr\\u003e❤ Palace of Love: Dual-Route Romance\\u003cbr\\u003eDefine your own gender and romance anyone — male, female, dominant or submissive — across 8 storylines. Balance a brooding immortal lord, a composed older sister, a fiery wild girl, and a fragile younger brother. Raise children, nurture spirit pets, explore an open map, and stack every romance buff to the max.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔒 Imprisoned by a Yandere: Everyone\\u0026#39;s Darling\\u003cbr\\u003eOvernight you become a villain\\u0026#39;s obsession — locked in his basement. You\\u0026#39;ve secretly bonded with a survival livestream system: escape his control and earn rewards. After a harrowing getaway, you realize you\\u0026#39;ve accidentally become everyone\\u0026#39;s favorite.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ The Art of Cultivation\\u003cbr\\u003eEveryone else is hunting for a soulmate. You\\u0026#39;re focused on training. Supreme immortal or carefree romance — your call. When your junior sister asks if she\\u0026#39;s the cutest, it feels like a freebie question... until a snow-white cat with blue eyes at the Meditation Pavilion turns it into a death trap.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎬 Star Simulator: A Glamorous Life\\u003cbr\\u003eLive out the celebrity dream. From auditions to filming, pick your scripts and directors. Rich random events keep every shoot exciting. Every actor you meet could become a key connection — plus 7 romance routes and thrilling signature scenes waiting to be unlocked.\\u003cbr\\u003e👶 One Night, One Life: CEO Surrenders\\u003cbr\\u003eOne accidental night with a billionaire CEO, then you slip away. You meet again — now you\\u0026#39;re his personal secretary, terrified of being exposed. Then a genius baby arrives, and the head of the Gong family stares at a tiny version of himself. The cold CEO launches an all-out pursuit.\\u003cbr\\u003e🐉 Monster Keeper: Spoiled by the Crazies\\u003cbr\\u003eYou land a high-risk job: Monster Keeper. $100K/month, full benefits. Your three charges? A yandere mermaid playing innocent. A loyal wolfman who loses control at night. A scheming snake who wants to lay eggs with you. Love? Soothing? No — bad monsters get properly disciplined.\\u003cbr\\u003eDive deep into every character. Unlock every hidden chapter. Your story starts now.\"],\"SPHERE NEWRGY PTE. LTD.\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jU1kHHk5vrx6BT_Cfe0q6aioOOclrQbuN_Y2IWIiWbHYM_I4LWoO7xDAB552d7OxdYFpIoKrsag7DNLZ85D_\"],null,[75,40,29,255]],null,[\"Rated for 16+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt\"]