.com/3DHCx-VOWwI4ysB_YHSEIhxT6wk9SmhpDyCEHHbjeRyJrjVJqWbaHNaUSCQMg1Hj3ERyWnBLg_vNiPrRye6yobk\"]],[null,2,[1350,2400],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/G1UjY003WntB8z7SAT3si93h6qfuspxVLefsdTabk7TGyLZ6NTqsbFSNeB6GzmCaQzEtN-ZyIhxR6vzYSKuW\"]],[null,2,[1800,3200],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QPyQcmLvNnwYXg1pKsHLpYU_pcSgZx2zvp1S_2vQ4e83uJ0PPjwPE0m9vm7FrqwK6mnv9upASCgpJ9jMqvPIAGU\"]],[null,2,[1800,3200],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kBlL6ZT2Zk_GNPG9M7U-MG5enwq2csHiNkwD4sNHhjJcLWWe41m0m4B9eBhA6f3ui5kG2W5vZtKBGe0tE43sPA\"]]],\"City Of Survivors\",[\"4.4\",4.36],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bibiboom.settlementheroes\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bibiboom.settlementheroes\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bibiboom.settlementheroes\"]],[\"qgJtGmsIUkoTCKLtirHHkJcDFf2nrAIdCDQci/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPwojCh1jb20uYmliaWJvb20uc2V0dGxlbWVudGhlcm9lcxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"S5M_6Pw5fPU\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:S5M_6Pw5fPU?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:S5M_6Pw5fPU\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezly5S8jrvu9g4g4XuYkVytNBdIonQU2FSsul6qLjG43Y1DllcbAGiGwhfcNkJj-MlGxj8QBmWtnEnSOzNWQasiJCS1n2Hh8RVwOXegKeLICSEuoxRWGQZi3KlZsU6kmnfhXa1C9WYsO-UAKwXa5ppswgvBYTiO5EqV_7iIJNP773lOK1FFkKJZ5nBIHKIIj52IHMrhaCiGm1lXSXnalcClyOu6ws4q_CeSctixmFAX5zzS6nJDyXVJ_Sf2eTtQLh4Esyi6CSC3GD1THK6OWyvGsMcgxcTw3-4njsMgn08AHUA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/S5M_6Pw5fPU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"A city-building game set in a zombie-apocalyptic world. As the leader of survivors, your tasks are to scavenge for resources, rescue survivors, recruit heroes, and construct and defend your cities. Explore the wilderness and fend off hordes of zombies. Can you rebuild society and survive the apocalypse?\\u003cbr\\u003eYou\\u0026#39;re in a world overrun by zombies. Your responsibility is to establish and manage cities in various locations, ensuring that survivors have safe places to live and sufficient resources. Venture into the wild, save more people, and gather additional resources to help your city grow.\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003eRebuild Cities: Start with an abandoned city. Expand it, adding tents and resource collection spots. Make sure people have enough food and medicine and feel safe.\\u003cbr\\u003eRecruit Heroes: Among the survivors, there are special individuals with unique abilities. Find these heroes and invite them to join your team. With their help, can strengthen your fight against zombies.\\u003cbr\\u003eRescue Survivors: Many people out there still need help. Locate them and bring them to your city. The more people we have, the better our chances in this fight for humanity.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect Resources: Construct facilities like a wood mill and fishing dock in your city. Gather resources to meet people\\u0026#39;s daily needs.\\u003cbr\\u003eFight zombies: Prepare for battles with zombies. Assemble a team and devise winning strategies. The priority is to keep both the city and its people safe.\"],\"Bibiboom\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yqcgUXB0XrXUl76b9dkPDD42CCzJqTv9EejSSNFLVkmaZ_SrWZyjO2b26_0waX6tLbe3eVPNjFVDVno8PTt4gg\"],null,[114,163,155,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Moderate Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"MYR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bibiboom.settlementheroes\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bibiboom.settlementheroes\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"RM 1.99 - RM 254.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0]]]]],null,[],true,[\"qgIMCgoKBlNUUkVBTRoA\"]]]",null,null,null,"generic"]]
